\v 16 He scolded the¦63654 ones selling¦63658 doves¦63657, saying¦63659, “\wj Get¦63660 them out of here¦63662! Don't¦63664 be¦63665 making¦63665 my¦63670 father's¦63669 house into a¦63671 market.\wj*”
\v 17 That¦63680 reminded¦63675 his followers¦63678 of¦63679 the¦63686 scripture: “I'll be filled with zeal¦63687 for your¦63690 temple¦63689.”\x + \xo 2:17: \xt Psa 69:9.\x*
