\v 19 But \nd Yeshua¦63710\nd* answered¦63708, “\wj Well, destroy¦63714 this¦63717 temple¦63716 and¦63718 I'll¦63722 raise¦63722\wj*\f + \fr 2:19 \ft We couldn't easily use \+em rebuild\+em* here because there's a play on words—see verse 21.\f* \wj it¦63723 again in¦63719 three¦63720 days¦63721.\wj*”\x + \xo 2:19: \xt Mat 26:61; 27:40; Mrk 14:58; 15:29.\x*
