\v 23 When¦63782 \add @Yeshua¦63784\add* was¦63784 at¦63788 the¦63789 Passover¦63790 Feast in Yerushalem¦63787, many¦63794 believed¦63795 in his¦63799 \add ≈authority\add* because they saw¦63800 the¦63802 miracles¦63803 that¦63804 he¦63805 was¦63805 able to do¦63805.
