\v 4 Nicodemus¦63925 questioned, “How¦63926 can an adult be¦63927 reborn? A¦63928 person¦63928 can't¦63935 just return¦63944 into¦63937 their mother's¦63941 womb¦63939 and¦63945 then get born¦63947 a second time!”
