\p
\v 1 After¦66762 all this, \nd Yeshua¦66766\nd* crossed the¦66768 lake¦66769 \add in a boat\add*.\f + \fr 6:1 \ft Here Yohan also uses the Roman name “Lake Tiberias” rather than just “Lake Galilee”.\f*
\v 2 A¦66781 large¦66782 crowd¦66781 followed¦66778 him¦66780 because¦66784 they'd¦66787 seen¦66787 his miraculous healings of sick people.
