\v 4 At that time, it was¦66817 getting close¦66820 to the¦66824 Jewish Festival¦66825 of¦66826 Passover¦66823.
\v 5 When \nd Yeshua¦66835\nd* looked out and¦66836 saw¦66837 the large¦66839 crowd¦66840 coming¦66842, he¦66845 asked¦66845 Philip¦66848, “\wj Where¦66849 can we¦66850 get enough food from to feed¦66856 all this crowd?\wj*”
