\v 8 \add Now\add* one¦66892 of¦66893 \add @Yeshua's\add* apprentices¦66895, Simon¦66900 Peter's¦66901 brother¦66899, Andrew¦66897, said¦66890 to¦66891 \add @Yeshua¦66891\add*,
\v 9 “There's¦66905 a¦66903 young¦66903 boy¦66903 here¦66905 with five¦66909 buns¦66910 and¦66912 two¦66913 \add small cooked\add* fish¦66914, but¦66915 that wouldn't even start to feed this crowd.”
