\v 10 But \nd Yeshua¦66926\nd* told¦66922 them to get all the¦66928 people¦66929 to¦66930 sit¦66930 down¦66930 as there¦66931 was¦66931 a large grassy¦66934 area. So¦66941 they all sat¦66940 down¦66940—some five¦66950 thousand¦66950 men¦66944 were counted¦66946.
\v 11 Then he took¦66951 the¦66954 buns¦66956 and¦66959 gave¦66960 thanks¦66960 \add to God\add*, and started passing around both the¦66970 buns and¦66974 the¦66976 fish¦66977, and everyone ate as¦66978 much¦66978 as¦66978 they¦66979 wanted¦66979.
