\v 21 After that¦67186 they¦67164 were¦67164 willing¦67164 to¦67166 let him¦67167 into¦67170 the¦67171 boat¦67172, and¦67173 immediately¦67174 the¦67176 boat¦67177 was at¦67180 their arrival place.
\rem /s1 The Bread from Heaven; Jesus, the Bread of Life; The People Seek Jesus
