\v 24 So¦67273 when¦67272 all the¦67276 people saw¦67274 that¦67278 \nd Yeshua¦67279\nd* wasn't around and his¦67289 apprentices¦67288 had left, they went¦67303 off \add ≈looking¦67306 for¦67306\add* \nd Yeshua¦67308\nd* in Capernaum¦67305.
\s1 The bread that enables true life
