\v 26 “\wj Honestly, I¦67332 know that you're not \+add ≈looking¦67334 for¦67334\+add* me¦67335 because¦67337 you¦67338 saw¦67338 \+add God working\+add* miracles¦67339,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦67327\nd* answered¦67324, “\wj but¦67342 because¦67343 you¦67344 all¦67344 had plenty of¦67345 food to fill you up.\wj*
