\v 33 \wj because¦67493 \nd God's¦67497\nd* bread¦67494 is¦67498 the¦67499 one who came¦67500 down¦67500 from heaven¦67503 and¦67504 who gives¦67506 life¦67505 to¦67509 the¦67509 world¦67510.\wj*”
\p
\v 34 So¦67512 they¦67511 requested, “Mister¦67515, keep giving¦67518 us that¦67522 bread¦67521.”
