\v 35 “\wj \+em I¦67529 am¦67530\+em* the¦67531 bread¦67532 that gives life¦67534,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦67528\nd* answered¦67523, “\wj anyone who comes¦67536 to¦67537 me¦67538 will never¦67539 hunger¦67541, and¦67544 the¦67545 one believing¦67546 in¦67547 me¦67548, will never¦67549 be¦67551 thirsty¦67551 again.\wj*
\v 36 \wj But¦67555 as I¦67556 said¦67556 already, although you have¦67560 seen¦67560 me¦67562 you¦67565 refuse to believe¦67565 me.\wj*
