\v 38 \wj because¦67586 I¦67587 came¦67587 down¦67587 from¦67588 heaven¦67591, not¦67592 to do what I¦67594 want, but¦67600 to do what the one who sent¦67604 me¦67605 wants.\wj*
\v 39 \wj And¦67608 what he wants is¦67609 for me¦67614 to not¦67622 lose¦67623 anyone that¦67616 he's¦67619 given¦67619 to¦67621 me¦67621, but¦67627 to \+add ≈bring them back to life\+add* on¦67633 the¦67633 last¦67634 day¦67635.\wj*
\v 40 \wj My¦67648 father¦67645 wants everyone¦67650 who watches¦67652 me and¦67655 believes¦67656 in¦67658 me to \+add ≈live\+add* forever¦67663, because¦67638 I¦67667 will¦67665 \+add ≈bring them back to life¦67662\+add* on¦67669 that¦67649 final¦67671 day¦67672.\wj*”
\p
\v 41 This \add little\add* speech made the¦67676 religious leaders grumble¦67673 about¦67678 him¦67679 because¦67680 he¦67681 had said¦67681 that \add %he¦67682\add* was¦67683 the¦67684 food¦67685 that came¦67687 down¦67687 from heaven¦67690,
