\v 45 \wj The¦67769 prophets¦67770 wrote¦67767 that¦67779 the people will¦67772 be¦67772 taught¦67774 by \+nd God¦67776\+nd*.\x + \xo 6:45: \xt Isa 54:13.\x* And everyone¦67777 who's heard¦67781 and¦67785 learnt¦67786 from¦67782 the¦67783 father¦67784 comes¦67789 to¦67790 me¦67791.\wj*
\v 46 \wj Not¦67792 that¦67793 any person has¦67797 seen¦67797 the¦67794 father¦67795—only¦67799 the¦67801 one who came from¦67803 \+nd God¦67806\+nd* has¦67809 seen¦67809 him.\wj*
