\p
\v 1 “\wj Honestly I¦71709 can tell¦71709 you¦71710: It's not¦71713 the person that enters¦71714 the¦71721 sheep¦71722 enclosure by the gate that¦71727 is¦71729 a¦71728 thief¦71728 and¦71730 robber¦71731, but rather the one who climbs¦71724 in a different¦71725 way¦71725.\wj*
