\v 5 \wj They¦71798 would never¦71796 follow¦71798 a¦71794 stranger¦71794 because¦71804 they¦71806 wouldn't know¦71806 his voice¦71810, in fact they'd run¦71801 away from¦71802 him¦71803.\wj*”
