\v 15 \wj just like¦72011 the¦72014 father¦72015 knows¦72012 me¦72013 and¦72016 I¦72016 know¦72017 the¦72018 father¦72019\x + \xo 10:15: \xt Mat 11:27; Luk 10:22.\x*—in fact I¦72024 will give my¦72023 life¦72022 for¦72026 the¦72027 sheep¦72029.\wj*
\v 16 \wj I¦72034 also have¦72034 other¦72031 sheep¦72033 which¦72035 are¦72038 not¦72037 in this¦72042 field¦72041 and it's¦72045 appropriate¦72045 for me¦72046 to¦72048 bring¦72048 those¦72043 other sheep also¦72049, then they'll¦72053 be¦72053 hearing¦72053 my¦72052 voice¦72051 because there'll be¦72056 just one¦72058 flock¦72059 with¦72060 one¦72060 shepherd¦72061.\wj*\x + \xo 10:16: \xt Eze 37:21-24.\x*
