\v 1 Now there was a¦72576 man¦72576 called Lazarus¦72579 who lived in the¦72583 village¦72584 of¦72586 Beyt-Ania \add !(Bethany)\add* along with his sisters¦72592 Martha¦72589 and Maria¦72586.\x + \xo 11:1: \xt Luk 10:38-39.\x*
