\v 8 But they double-checked, “Honoured¦72732 teacher, the¦72737 Yudeans wanted¦72734 to¦72736 execute you¦72735, so¦72739 do you¦72741 \add really\add* want to go¦72741 back there¦72742 again¦72740?”
