\v 9 And \nd Yeshua¦72745\nd* answered¦72743, “\wj There are¦72751 twelve¦72747 hours¦72749 of¦72753 light in the¦72753 day¦72755. Anyone¦72758 who walks¦72759 during¦72760 the¦72761 daytime¦72762 doesn't stumble¦72765 because¦72766 he¦72773 is¦72773 seeing¦72773 the¦72767 light¦72768 \+add that shines in\+add* this¦72771 world¦72770.\wj*
