\v 16 Thomas¦72873 (nicknamed¦72875 ‘Twin¦72876’) grumbled to¦72877 the¦72877 others, “Yeah, we¦72882 might as well go¦72880 so¦72872 that¦72883 we¦72884 can get killed as well.”
