\v 50 Don't you¦73561 all¦73561 realise that¦73563 it's¦73564 better for¦73565 all¦73565 of us if one¦73568 man¦73569 dies¦73570 so that the¦73572 people¦73573 and¦73574 the¦73577 nation¦73578 won't be destroyed?”
