\r (Mat. 21:1-11; Mark 11:1-11; Luke 19:28-40)
\p
\v 12 The¦73981 next¦73982 day¦73981 a large¦73986 crowd¦73984 of people who had¦73988 come¦73988 for the¦73990 celebrations and had¦73993 heard¦73993 that¦73994 \nd Yeshua¦73997\nd* was¦73995 coming¦73995 to¦73999 Yerushalem¦74000
\v 13 took¦74001 \add long\add* branches¦74003 from palm¦74005 trees¦74005 and¦74006 brought them out¦74007 as they went¦74007 to¦74012 meet¦74009 him¦74012. They¦74015 called¦74015 out¦74015, “Honoured¦74019 saviour¦74019! The¦74022 one coming¦74023 in¦74024 \nd Yahweh's\nd* \add ≈authority\add* has¦74021 been¦74021 blessed¦74021 \add by God\add*.\x + \xo 12:13: \xt Psa 118:25-26.\x* This is¦74021 Yisrael's¦74031 king¦74029.”
\p
\v 14 Now \nd Yeshua¦74035\nd* had¦74032 found¦74032 a¦74036 young¦74036 donkey¦74036 and rode¦74037 it¦74039 \add into the city\add* just like¦74040 it was written¦74042 \add in the scriptures\add*,
\q1
\v 15 “Don't¦74043 be¦74044 worried you children of¦74047 Tsiyon/Zion. Your¦74051 king¦74050 is¦74052 coming¦74052 mounted on¦74054 a¦74057 donkey's¦74057 foal.”\x + \xo 12:15: \xt Zech 9:9.\x*
\p
\v 16 (\nd \+add @Yeshua's¦74063\+add*\nd* apprentices didn't¦74060 realise¦74062 all these¦74058 \add >things\add* at the¦74067 time, but¦74069 it was later after \nd Yeshua¦74073\nd* was¦74071 lifted up to heaven that they¦74075 were¦74075 reminded¦74075 that¦74076 these¦74077 \add >things\add* had¦74086 been¦74086 written¦74086 about¦74080 him¦74083, and¦74087 that they¦74089 had \add indeed\add* happened to¦74090 him¦74090.)
\p
\v 17 People in the¦74093 crowd¦74094 were¦74091 telling each other about¦74104 how they'd been¦74096 with¦74097 \add @Yeshua¦74098\add* when¦74099 he'd¦74103 called¦74103 Lazarus¦74102 out¦74104 from the¦74105 \add ≈burial¦74106 chamber¦74106\add* and¦74107 \add ≈brought him¦74109 back to life\add*,
\v 18 So because¦74112 of¦74112 this¦74113, others also¦74114 wanted to met¦74115 \add @Yeshua¦74117\add* because¦74123 they'd¦74124 heard¦74124 that he'd done¦74129 that¦74126 miracle¦74131.
\v 19 So¦74133 the¦74132 Pharisees¦74134 discussed this together, “We're getting nowhere with this. Look¦74145, it seems like the¦74146 whole world¦74147 wants to follow him¦74150.”
\s1 Some Greeks want to meet Yeshua
\rem /s1 Jesus Predicts His Death; Some Greeks Seek Jesus; Some Greeks Wish to See Jesus
\p
\v 20 And¦74153 some¦74157 Greek people were also going¦74160 \add to Yerushalem\add* to worship¦74163 \add God\add* at¦74165 the¦74166 celebrations
\v 21 and they approached¦74170 Philip¦74172 from¦74174 Bethsaida¦74175 (up in Galilee¦74177) and¦74178 asked¦74179 him¦74180, “Mister¦74182, we'd¦74183 like to¦74186 meet¦74186 this \nd Yeshua¦74185\nd*.”
\v 22 So Philip¦74189 went¦74187 and¦74190 told¦74191 Andrew, and¦74200 \add *the two of them\add* went¦74196 and¦74203 told¦74204 \nd Yeshua¦74206\nd*.
\s1 Yeshua predicts his death again
\p
\v 23 Now \nd Yeshua¦74209\nd* told¦74213 them¦74212, “\wj The¦74215 time¦74216 has¦74214 come¦74214 for the¦74219 son¦74220 of¦74222 humanity¦74222 to be¦74218 honoured.\wj*
\v 24 \wj I¦74225 can assure you¦74226 that unless a wheat¦74232 seed¦74230 drops¦74233 into¦74234 the¦74235 ground¦74236 and dies, it will stay¦74240 just¦74239 as it¦74238 is¦74240, but¦74242 if¦74241 it¦74243 dies¦74243, it's¦74246 able to produce¦74245 a harvest.\wj*
\v 25 \wj Anyone who loves¦74248 their life¦74250 will lose¦74252 it¦74254, but¦74255 the¦74256 person hating¦74257 their life¦74259 in¦74261 this¦74264 world¦74263 will¦74270 stay alive forever¦74269.\wj*\x + \xo 12:25: \xt Mat 10:39; 16:25; Mrk 8:35; Luk 9:24; 17:33.\x*
\v 26 \wj Anyone¦74274 who wants to serve¦74276 me¦74273 needs¦74282 to follow¦74282 after¦74281 me¦74281, so¦74283 that wherever¦74284 I am¦74286, my¦74294 servant¦74292 will¦74295 also¦74290 be¦74295 there¦74289. Anyone¦74300 who serves¦74302 me¦74301 will¦74303 be¦74303 honoured¦74303 by the¦74305 father¦74306.\wj*
\rem /s1 Jesus Speaks about His Death
\p
\v 27 \wj Now¦74308, I'm very troubled¦74312. What¦74314 else could¦74315 I¦74315 say¦74315 other than, ‘Father¦74316, let me¦74318 avoid what's coming’? But¦74323 it was exactly this¦74325 that I¦74326 came¦74326 for.\wj*
\v 28 \wj Father¦74331, may your¦74335 \+add ≈authority\+add* be honoured.\wj*”
\p And a¦74354 voice¦74354 from the¦74356 sky¦74357 answered, “I've¦74360 already brought honour¦74333 to it¦74360 and¦74361 will¦74363 do so again¦74362.”
\p
\v 29 This caused some in the¦74364 crowd¦74367 standing¦74369 there to say that they'd heard¦74371 thunder¦74375 while others¦74379 said¦74381 that a messenger¦74384 must have¦74386 spoken¦74386 to¦74385 \add @Yeshua¦74385\add*.
\p
\v 30 “\wj That¦74400 voice¦74399 wasn't for¦74395 my sake,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦74393\nd* responded, “\wj but¦74403 for¦74404 all¦74405 of¦74404 you¦74405.\wj*
\v 31 \wj This¦74411 world¦74410 is about to \+add ≈be judged¦74407\+add* and its ruler¦74414 will¦74419 be¦74419 thrown¦74419 out,\wj*
\v 32 \wj and¦74422 when I'm¦74422 lifted¦74427 up¦74427\wj*\f + \fr 12:32 \ft lifted up / exalted: See https://bibleDifferences.net/2019/04/25/156-exulted\f* \wj from¦74428 the¦74430 earth¦74431, I¦74434 will¦74434 attract¦74434 everyone¦74432 towards me.\wj*”
\v 33 By saying¦74441 this¦74438, he was indicating¦74442 how he¦74445 was¦74445 going¦74445 to¦74446 die¦74446.
\p
\v 34 So¦74448 the¦74450 crowd¦74451 queried him¦74449, “We¦74452 heard¦74453 from the¦74455 scriptures that¦74457 the¦74458 \nd messiah¦74459\nd* will stay¦74460 until the end of the¦74462 age¦74463\x + \xo 12:34: \xt Psa 110:4; Isa 9:7; Eze 37:25; Dan 7:14.\x* so¦74464 why do you¦74468 say¦74467 that¦74469 the¦74472 son¦74473 of¦74475 humanity¦74475 will be¦74471 lifted¦74471 up¦74471? And who¦74476 is¦74477 this¦74479 ‘the¦74480 son¦74481 of¦74483 humanity¦74483’?”
\p
\v 35 \nd Yeshua¦74488\nd* answered¦74484 them¦74486, “\wj The¦74492 light¦74493 will be¦74498 among you¦74496 all¦74496 for just a¦74490 little¦74490 bit longer, so get walking¦74499 while¦74501 you¦74505 have¦74505 the¦74503 light¦74504 so that¦74506 you¦74509 won't¦74507 have to deal with darkness¦74508. Anyone walking¦74516 in¦74517 the¦74518 dark¦74519 doesn't know¦74521 where¦74522 they're going¦74523.\wj*
\v 36 \wj While¦74524 you¦74528 still have¦74528 the¦74526 light¦74527, believe¦74529 in¦74530 the¦74531 light¦74532 so that¦74533 you¦74537 will become¦74537 children¦74534 of¦74536 light¦74536.\wj*”
\rem /s1 The Jews Continue in Their Unbelief; The Unbelief of the People
\p \nd Yeshua¦74541\nd* said¦74539 these¦74538 \add >things\add* and¦74542 then after leaving¦74543 them, he was¦74546 hidden¦74546 from¦74547 them¦74548.
