\v 37 Even though \add @Yeshua\add* had¦74554 done¦74554 so¦74549 many¦74549 miracles¦74553 \add ≈in¦74555 front¦74555 of¦74555\add* the people, they¦74558 didn't¦74557 believe¦74558 that he was the messiah.
