\v 39 Because¦74583 of¦74583 this¦74584, they¦74586 weren't able¦74586 to¦74587 believe¦74587, and again as Yeshayah¦74593 wrote,
\q1
\v 40 “He¦74594 has¦74594 blinded¦74594 their¦74595 eyes¦74597 and¦74598 maimed¦74600 their¦74602 emotions,
\q1 so that¦74605 they¦74607 can't¦74606 see¦74607 with¦74608 their¦74608 eyes¦74609 and¦74610 understand¦74612 with¦74614 their¦74614 minds¦74615,
\q2 or they¦74618 might¦74618 be¦74618 turned¦74618 and¦74621 then I¦74622 would¦74622 heal¦74622 them¦74624.”\x + \xo 12:40: \xt Isa 6:10 (LXX).\x*
