\v 41 Yeshayah¦74628 wrote this because¦74629 he¦74632 saw¦74632 the¦74633 messiah's greatness¦74634\x + \xo 12:41: \xt Isa 6:1-5.\x* and¦74638 spoke¦74639 concerning¦74640 him¦74641.
\v 42 Likewise¦74642, many¦74649 of¦74647 the¦74647 \add Jewish\add* leaders¦74648 believed¦74650 that¦74659 \add @Yeshua¦74652\add* was the messiah, but¦74653 they didn't tell others because¦74654 they didn't want the¦74655 Pharisee¦74656 party¦74656 to banish them from their services
\v 43 as they¦74664 valued the¦74666 praise of¦74669 people¦74669 more¦74670 than¦74671 praise from \nd God¦74676\nd*.
\s1 It's Yeshua's teachings that will judge the hearers
