\p
\v 44 Then¦74680 \nd Yeshua¦74677\nd* called¦74681 out¦74681, “\wj Anyone who believes¦74689 that I came from God is¦74693 not¦74692 \+add just\+add* believing¦74693 in¦74694 me¦74695, but¦74696 \+add also\+add* \+add ≡believing¦74693\+add* in¦74697 the¦74698 one who sent¦74699 me¦74700,\wj*
\v 45 \wj and¦74701 anyone who watches¦74703 me¦74704 \+add working\+add*, is¦74705 watching¦74705 the¦74707 one who sent¦74708 me¦74709.\wj*
\v 46 \wj I¦74710 came¦74715 into¦74712 this world¦74714 as¦74711 light¦74711 so that¦74716 anyone who believes¦74719 in¦74720 me¦74721 won't¦74725 have darkness¦74724 residing in them.\wj*
\v 47 \wj I¦74742 won't be¦74744 judging¦74744 anyone¦74730 who hears¦74733 my¦74731 teaching and¦74737 doesn't obey it, because¦74747 I¦74748 didn't come¦74748 to judge¦74750 the¦74751 world¦74752 but¦74753 rather to save¦74755 it.\wj*
\v 48 \wj Anyone who rejects¦74759 me¦74760 and¦74761 doesn't accept¦74763 my¦74766 teaching does have¦74767 a judge¦74769 though—it's the¦74771 message¦74772 that¦74773 I¦74774 spoke¦74774 that¦74775 will¦74776 judge¦74776 them at¦74779 the¦74780 end¦74781 of time¦74782\wj*
\v 49 \wj because¦74783 I¦74784 wasn't speaking¦74789 from¦74785 my own thoughts, but¦74790 it was the¦74791 father¦74794 himself¦74795 who sent¦74792 me¦74793 that told me¦74796 what¦74801 to say¦74802 and¦74803 what¦74804 to teach.\wj*
\v 50 \wj And¦74806 I'm¦74807 \+add fully\+add* aware that¦74808 \+add obeying\+add* his¦74811 \+add #commands¦74810\+add* leads to \+add ≈living¦74812\+add* forever¦74813. Therefore¦74818 whenever I¦74819 speak¦74820, I just say whatever the¦74825 father¦74826 said¦74823 to¦74824 me¦74824.\wj*”
\c 13
\s1 Yeshua washes the feet of his apprentices
\rem /s1 Jesus Washes the Disciples' Feet; Jesus Washes His Disciples' Feet; Farewell discourses
\p
\v 1 Even before¦74829 the¦74831 \add actual\add* feast¦74832 part of¦74833 the¦74833 Passover¦74834 celebrations, \nd Yeshua¦74837\nd* knew¦74835 that¦74838 his¦74843 time had come¦74839—the time when he¦74847 would leave¦74847 this¦74852 world¦74851 and \add return\add* to¦74853 the¦74854 father¦74855. He loved¦74856 his¦74857 followers who¦74860 were¦74860 in¦74861 the¦74862 world¦74863 right through to¦74864 the¦74865 end¦74865.
\p
\v 2 And¦74868 now it was getting near time for the dinner¦74869 and the¦74872 devil¦74874 had already¦74875 put¦74876 into¦74877 Yudas¦74883 Iscariot's¦74889 \add ≈mind¦74879\add* \add the idea\add* of¦74885 handing Yeshua over¦74881 \add to the authorities\add*.
\v 3 \add @Yeshua\add* knew¦74894 that¦74897 the¦74902 father¦74903 had¦74899 given¦74899 everything to¦74901 him¦74901, \add ≈putting it under his¦74905 control\add*, and¦74909 he knew that¦74910 he¦74913 had come¦74913 from¦74911 \nd God¦74912\nd* and¦74914 would return to¦74916 \nd God¦74918\nd*.
\v 4 So he¦74920 got up from¦74921 the¦74922 dinner¦74923 \add table\add*, changed out of his¦74926 clothes¦74927, and¦74929 wrapped a¦74931 linen¦74931 towel¦74931 around himself¦74934.
\v 5 Then he¦74937 put¦74937 water¦74938 into¦74940 the¦74941 wash¦74942 bowl and¦74944 started¦74945 washing¦74947 the¦74948 feet¦74949 of¦74950 \add &his¦74950\add* apprentices¦74951, wiping¦74954 them¦74954 dry with¦74955 the¦74955 linen¦74956 towel¦74956 that¦74957 he¦74958 was¦74958 wearing wrapped around him.
\v 6 After he'd washed a few, he¦74960 got to¦74962 Simon¦74964 Peter¦74965 who asked¦74968 him¦74969, “\nd Master¦74971\nd*, are¦74974 you¦74972 going to wash¦74974 my¦74973 feet¦74976?”
\p
\v 7 “\wj What¦74982 I'm¦74984 doing¦74985 now¦74990,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦74978\nd* answered¦74977, “\wj you won't¦74988 \+add really\+add* understand, but¦74995 in the future you¦74994 will¦74994.\wj*”
\p
\v 8 Peter¦75001 responded¦74999, “Well I'm never¦75003 ever going to¦75000 let you¦75006 wash¦75006 \em my\em* feet¦75010!”
\p “\wj If¦75020 I¦75022 don't¦75021 wash¦75022 them,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦75018\nd* answered¦75015, “\wj then you¦75023 won't be¦75025 included in my \+add group\+add*.\wj*”
\p
\v 9 “Well, if that's so,” Peter¦75032 said¦75029, “don't¦75035 just¦75040 wash my¦75039 feet¦75038 but¦75041 my¦75043 hands¦75044 and¦75045 my¦75046 head¦75047 as well.”
\p
\v 10 \nd Yeshua¦75051\nd* responded¦75048, “\wj Any person who's already washed¦75053 \+add themselves\+add* only¦75061 needs¦75057 to¦75067 wash¦75067 \+add &their¦75064\+add* feet¦75065 \+add now\+add* to be¦75069 clean¦75071. And¦75074 so you're¦75075 clean¦75076, but¦75078 not¦75079 every¦75080 one of you.\wj*”
\v 11 He¦75089 said¦75089 this¦75088 last bit because¦75082 he¦75081 already knew¦75081 who was going to hand¦75085 him¦75086 over¦75085.
\p
\v 12 So¦75096 when¦75095 he'd¦75097 finished washing¦75097 their¦75100 feet¦75099,\x + \xo 13:12-15: \xt Luk 22:27.\x* he got¦75102 dressed¦75104 again¦75111 and¦75108 sat¦75110 down¦75110 and asked¦75112, “\wj Do you¦75114 know¦75114 what¦75115 I¦75116 just did¦75116 to¦75117 you¦75117 all¦75117?\wj*
\v 13 \wj You¦75118 call¦75119 me¦75120 teacher¦75122 and¦75123 \+nd master¦75125\+nd*, and¦75126 so you¦75128 should, because¦75131 I¦75130 am¦75130.\wj*
\v 14 \wj So¦75145 if¦75144 the¦75152 \+nd master¦75153\+nd* and¦75154 teacher¦75156 of¦75148 you¦75148 all¦75148 washed¦75147 your feet¦75150, then you¦75160 also¦75159 ought¦75162 to¦75164 wash¦75164 each other's feet¦75167.\wj*
\v 15 \wj I¦75170 have given¦75170 this to¦75172 you¦75172 all¦75172 as an¦75168 example¦75168 that¦75173 you can also¦75178 do¦75180 to others.\wj*
\v 16 \wj I¦75184 can assure you¦75185 that a¦75188 slave¦75188 isn't greater¦75189 than¦75189 his¦75192 master¦75191, and a missionary¦75195 isn't greater¦75196 than¦75196 the¦75198 \+add king\+add* who sends¦75199 him¦75200.\wj*\x + \xo 13:16: \xt Mat 10:24; Luk 6:40; Yhn 15:20.\x*
\v 17 \wj If¦75201 you¦75203 can figure all¦75203 this out and then do it, you¦75205 will be¦75205 blessed¦75204 \+add by God\+add*.\wj*
\rem /s1 Jesus Predicts His Betrayal
\p
\v 18 “\wj But I'm¦75213 not¦75209 talking¦75213 about¦75210 all¦75211 of¦75212 you¦75212. I¦75214 know¦75216 each¦75218 one that I¦75219 chose¦75219, but¦75220 this that was \+add written\+add* in¦75221 the¦75223 \+add #scriptures¦75224\+add* must be¦75225 fulfilled¦75225,\wj*
\q1 \wj ‘The one sharing food¦75231 with¦75228 me¦75229, lifted¦75232 up¦75232 his¦75238 boot against¦75234 me¦75235.’\wj*\x + \xo 13:18: \xt Psa 41:9.\x*
\m
\v 19 \wj So I'm¦75241 telling¦75241 you¦75242 now¦75240 before¦75243 it happens so that¦75246 when¦75249 it does happen, then you'll¦75247 all¦75247 believe¦75247 that¦75253 I¦75254 am¦75255 \+add the messiah\+add*.\wj*
\v 20 \wj I¦75258 can assure you¦75259 all¦75259 that anyone¦75265 who accepts any person that I¦75266 might¦75266 send¦75266, they're accepting¦75268 me¦75267, and¦75271 anyone who accepts me¦75272, is¦75275 accepting¦75275 the¦75277 one who sent¦75278 me¦75279.\wj*”\x + \xo 13:20: \xt Mat 10:40; Mrk 9:37; Luk 9:48; 10:16.\x*
\s1 Yeshua indicates who will hand him over
