\p
\v 21 After saying¦75281 these¦75280 \add >things\add*, \nd Yeshua's¦75283\nd* thoughts were¦75284 troubled¦75284 and he said¦75291, “\wj I¦75294 can assure you¦75296 that¦75298 one¦75299 of¦75300 you¦75301 will¦75302 be¦75302 turning me¦75303 in.\wj*”
\p
\v 22 This made \add &his¦75311\add* apprentices¦75312 glance around at each other, puzzled¦75314 about¦75316 which one¦75310 he¦75318 was¦75318 talking¦75318 about.
\v 23 \nd One¦75322\nd* of¦75323 them that \nd Yeshua¦75337\nd* especially liked,\f + \fr 13:23 \ft This apprentice, unnamed here, is assumed to be the author of this account (being shy or modest).\f* was leaning against him¦75326 \add at the table\add*.
\v 24 So¦75339 Simon¦75341 Peter¦75342 nodded¦75338 to¦75340 him to¦75344 \add ≈find out\add* who¦75345 \add @Yeshua¦75347\add* had been¦75347 talking¦75360 about¦75358,
\v 25 and he leaned¦75363 back¦75363 on¦75368 \nd Yeshua¦75372\nd* and asked¦75373 \add quietly\add*, “\nd Master¦75375\nd*, who¦75376 is¦75377 it¦75377?”
\p
\v 26 “\wj It's the¦75381 one I¦75389 hand¦75396 this piece¦75395 of¦75395 bread¦75395 to after I've dipped it¦75396 \+add in the sauce\+add*,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦75382\nd* answered¦75378. Then¦75397 after dipping¦75400 his piece¦75404 of¦75404 bread¦75404 in, he¦75407 gave¦75407 it to¦75408 Yudas¦75408 Iscariot¦75412.
\v 27 After¦75414 \add Yudas accepted\add* the¦75415 piece¦75416 of¦75416 bread¦75416, Satan¦75422 entered¦75418 into¦75419 him, and then¦75417 \nd Yeshua¦75428\nd* told¦75424 him¦75426, “What¦75429 you're¦75430 about to do¦75430, do¦75431 it soon¦75433.”
\v 28 But¦75435 none of¦75438 the¦75438 others sitting¦75439 around the table knew¦75437 what¦75441 \add @Yeshua\add* meant.
\v 29 Some¦75444 of them thought¦75447 that since¦75449 Yudas¦75455 held their purse, perhaps \nd Yeshua¦75460\nd* was¦75457 getting him¦75458 to buy¦75463 something they needed¦75465 for¦75467 the¦75468 feast¦75469 or¦75470 to give¦75475 something to¦75471 the¦75471 poor¦75472.
\p
\v 30 Anyway, having¦75476 eaten the¦75478 piece¦75479 of¦75479 bread¦75479, \add @Yudas\add* went¦75482 straight outside¦75482 where it¦75484 was¦75484 \add already\add* dark¦75486.
\s1 The new command to love each other
