\p
\v 31 After \add @Yudas¦75489\add* had gone, \nd Yeshua¦75492\nd* told¦75490 the others, “\wj Now¦75493 the¦75495 son¦75496 of¦75498 humanity¦75498 will be¦75494 honoured and¦75499 \+nd God¦75501\+nd* will be¦75502 honoured through him¦75504.\wj*
\v 32 \wj Also¦75512 \+nd God¦75514\+nd* himself¦75518 will¦75515 be¦75515 honouring him¦75516 and¦75520 will do that immediately¦75521.\wj*
\v 33 \wj My friends, I'll¦75532 only be¦75532 with¦75530 you a¦75528 little¦75528 bit longer. Then you'll all look¦75533 for me¦75534 and¦75535 as¦75536 I¦75537 told¦75537\wj* \wj the¦75539 religious leaders, you¦75546 won't¦75547 be¦75548 able¦75548 to¦75549 go where¦75542 I'm¦75543 going¦75544.\x + \xo 13:33: \xt Yhn 7:34.\x* So now¦75554 I've¦75552 also¦75550 told¦75552 all of you.\wj*
\v 34 \wj I'm¦75557 giving¦75557 you¦75558 a¦75555 new¦75556 command¦75555—you¦75560 need to love¦75560 each other. The way that I¦75565 loved¦75565 all¦75566 of you¦75569 is¦75571 how you should love¦75571 each other.\wj*\x + \xo 13:34: \xt Yhn 15:12,17; 1Yhn 3:23; 2Yhn 5.\x*
\v 35 \wj This¦75575 is¦75577 \+add actually\+add* how you'll know¦75577 if you're¦75583 my¦75581 \+add #follower¦75582\+add*: if¦75585 you're¦75587 loving¦75586 each other.\wj*”
