\p “\wj Where¦75605 I'm¦75607 going¦75607,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦75604\nd* answered¦75600, “\wj you¦75609 won't¦75608 be¦75609 able¦75609 to¦75612 follow¦75612 me¦75610 at this stage, but¦75618 you¦75617 will¦75617 follow¦75617 me eventually.\wj*”
