\p
\v 1 \add Yeshua continued telling them,\add* “\wj Don't¦75685 be¦75686 living in fear. You believe¦75690 that \+nd God¦75693\+nd* is real, and¦75694 you¦75697 also¦75694 believe¦75697 that I was sent by him.\wj*
\v 2 \wj There are many¦75705 places to live in¦75698 my¦75703 father's¦75702 residence—I¦75711 would¦75712 have told¦75711 you¦75713 if¦75707 there wasn't because¦75714 I'm¦75715 going¦75715 there to¦75716 prepare¦75716 a¦75717 place¦75717 for¦75718 all of you.\wj*
\v 3 \wj And¦75721 after I've¦75723 gone¦75723 to prepare¦75725 that place¦75728, then I'll¦75733 be¦75733 coming¦75733 back again¦75732 and¦75735 will¦75736 bring you¦75737 to¦75738 myself¦75739, so that¦75740 where¦75741 I am, you¦75746 can all¦75746 be¦75747 there also¦75745.\wj*
\v 4 \wj You¦75753 know¦75753 how to get where¦75750 I'm¦75751 going¦75752.\wj*”
\rem /s1 Jesus the Way to the Father
\p
\v 5 “\nd Master¦75764\nd*,” Thomas¦75760 asked¦75758, “we¦75766 don't¦75765 \add even\add* know¦75766 \em where¦75767\em* you're¦75768 going¦75768, let alone how¦75770 to¦75775 get there.”
\p
\v 6 And \nd Yeshua¦75781\nd* answered¦75778, “\wj \+em I¦75782 am¦75783\+em* the¦75784 path¦75785 and¦75786 the¦75787 truth¦75788 and¦75789 the¦75790 life¦75791. No¦75792 one¦75792 can get to¦75794 the¦75795 father¦75796 except¦75797 via me¦75800.\wj*
\v 7 \wj If¦75801 you¦75803 had¦75803 all known¦75803 me¦75804, you¦75811 would also¦75805 have known¦75811 my¦75808 father¦75807, and¦75813 from¦75814 now¦75815 on you¦75816 do know¦75816 him¦75818 and¦75819 have¦75820 seen¦75820 him¦75821.\wj*”
\p
\v 8 So Philip¦75825 said¦75822, “\nd Master¦75826\nd*, show¦75827 us the¦75829 father¦75830 and¦75831 that'll be¦75832 enough for¦75833 us¦75833.”
\p
\v 9 “\wj I've¦75844 been¦75844 with¦75842 you¦75843 all¦75843 for quite some time¦75840,\wj*” \nd Yeshua¦75837\nd* replied¦75834, “\wj and¦75845 yet you¦75847 still don't¦75846 \+add even\+add* know¦75847 me¦75848, Philip¦75849.\wj*
\v 10 \wj You¦75867 don't¦75866 believe¦75867 that¦75869 I¦75870 am in¦75871 the¦75872 father¦75873 and¦75874 the¦75875 father¦75876 is¦75879 in¦75877 me¦75878. These things that¦75882 I've¦75883 been¦75884 telling¦75884 you¦75887 all¦75887, I¦75891 don't¦75890 \+add just\+add* make them up myself¦75889, but¦75893 the¦75894 father¦75894 who lives in¦75896 me¦75897 is¦75900 doing¦75900 what he wants.\wj*
\v 11 \wj You all need to believe¦75905 that¦75907 I¦75908 am in¦75909 the¦75910 father¦75911 and¦75912 the¦75913 father¦75914 is in¦75915 me¦75916. If¦75921 that's hard, at least believe¦75930 it because¦75925 of¦75925 what he's doing.\wj*
\v 12 \wj I¦75935 can assure you¦75936 all¦75936 that anyone who believes¦75938 \+add that God sent\+add* me¦75940 and is the source of the miracles that¦75943 I¦75944 do¦75945, that¦75946 person will¦75947 be¦75947 able to do¦75947 the same and¦75949 even greater¦75950 miracles because¦75953 I¦75954 am¦75959 going¦75959 to¦75955 the¦75956 father¦75957.\wj*
\v 13 \wj Whatever¦75962 you¦75966 request¦75966 from me with my¦75973 \+add ≈name¦75972 and authority\+add*, I¦75975 will¦75975 do¦75975 it so that¦75976 the¦75978 father¦75979 might¦75977 be¦75977 honoured because of the¦75981 son¦75982.\wj*
\v 14 \wj Anything¦75985 that¦75992 you¦75986 all¦75986 request¦75986 using my¦75991 \+add ≈name¦75990 and authority\+add* will¦75994 be¦75994 done¦75994.\wj*
\s1 The father will be sending a different advocate
\rem /s1 The Promise of the Holy Spirit; Jesus Promises the Holy Spirit
\p
\v 15 “\wj If¦75995 you¦75996 all¦75996 love¦75996 me¦75998, you¦76003 will¦76003 obey my¦76002 commands¦76000.\wj*
\v 16 \wj Then¦76006 I¦76006 will¦76009 ask¦76009 the¦76011 father¦76012, and¦76013 he¦76017 will¦76017 give¦76017 you \+add ≈a different¦76015\+add* assistant to¦76018 be¦76028 with¦76022 you¦76023 all¦76023 for this age¦76027—\wj*
\v 17 \wj the¦76032 \+nd spirit¦76033\+nd* of¦76035 truth¦76035. The¦76037 world¦76038 can't¦76039 accept¦76041 him, because¦76042 it¦76044 doesn't see or know him.\wj*
\p
\v 18 “\wj And I¦76066 won't¦76065 leave¦76066 you¦76067 all¦76067 here as orphans¦76068, but I'll¦76069 come¦76069 back to¦76070 you¦76071.\wj*
\v 19 \wj It won't be long now and¦76074 the¦76075 world¦76076 won't see¦76079 me¦76077 any more, but¦76081 you¦76080 will¦76082 see¦76082 me¦76083 because¦76084 I'll¦76085 be¦76086 alive¦76086 and¦76088 you¦76089 all¦76089 will¦76090 be¦76090 alive¦76090 also¦76088.\wj*
\v 20 \wj At that¦76093 time¦76095 you will¦76097 know¦76097 that¦76099 I¦76100 am in¦76101 my¦76104 father¦76103, and¦76105 you¦76106 all¦76106 are in¦76107 me¦76108, and¦76109 I¦76109 am in¦76112 you¦76113 all¦76113.\wj*
\p
\v 21 “\wj Anyone who takes my commands¦76117 and¦76119 obeys them¦76121, that's¦76122 the¦76124 person who loves¦76125 me¦76126, and¦76128 anyone who loves¦76129 me¦76130 will¦76131 be¦76131 loved¦76131 by¦76133 my father¦76135, and¦76137 I¦76137 \+add too\+add* will¦76140 be¦76140 loving¦76140 them and¦76142 will¦76143 be¦76143 revealing myself¦76146 to¦76145 them.\wj*”
\p
\v 22 Yudas¦76151 (not¦76152 Yudas Iscariot¦76156) asked¦76147, “\nd Master¦76158\nd*, what's¦76160 going¦76165 on? Why would you reveal yourself¦76170 to¦76164 us¦76164 and¦76171 not¦76172 to¦76173 the¦76173 \add whole\add* world¦76174?”
\p
\v 23 \nd Yeshua¦76177\nd* answered¦76175, “\wj If¦76181 anyone¦76182 loves¦76183 me¦76184, they'll obey my¦76187 teaching, and¦76190 my¦76193 father¦76192 will¦76194 love¦76194 them and¦76196 we¦76200 will¦76200 go to¦76197 that person and¦76203 live¦76206 with¦76207 them.\wj*
\v 24 \wj But anyone who doesn't love¦76214 me¦76215, won't¦76221 obey my¦76220 teaching. The¦76225 words¦76226 that¦76229 you¦76230 hear¦76230 from me are¦76232 not¦76231 my own, but¦76234 come from the¦76235 father¦76238 who sent¦76236 me¦76237.\wj*
\p
\v 25 “\wj I¦76240 told¦76240 you¦76241 all¦76241 this while I have been here with¦76242 you¦76243 all¦76243.\wj*
\v 26 \wj But¦76246 the¦76251 holy¦76252 \+nd spirit¦76250\+nd*, the assistant who¦76253 the¦76256 father¦76257 will¦76254 be¦76254 sending¦76254 with my¦76262 \+add ≈authority\+add*, he will¦76265 be¦76265 teaching¦76265 you¦76264 everything, and¦76267 will¦76268 be¦76268 reminding¦76268 you¦76269 of everything that¦76271 I¦76273 told¦76273 you¦76275 all¦76275.\wj*
\p
\v 27 \wj I¦76278 will leave¦76278 peace¦76277 with¦76279 you¦76279 all¦76279. I'm¦76283 giving¦76283 my¦76282 peace¦76280 to¦76284 you¦76284 all¦76284, but what I'm giving isn't¦76285 like¦76286 what the¦76287 world¦76288 gives. Don't¦76294 be¦76295 upset¦76295 or afraid¦76300.\wj*
\v 28 \wj You¦76301 all¦76301 heard¦76301 me say¦76304 that¦76302 I'm¦76306 going¦76306 away¦76306 and¦76307 then will be¦76308 coming¦76308 back. If¦76311 you¦76312 \+add really\+add* loved¦76312 me¦76314, you'd¦76315 be¦76315 very happy¦76315 that¦76317 I'm¦76319 going¦76319 to¦76320 the¦76321 father¦76322, because¦76324 the¦76325 father¦76326 is¦76330 greater¦76328 than¦76328 me¦76329.\wj*
\p
\v 29 \wj But¦76331 I've¦76333 told¦76333 you¦76334 now¦76332 before¦76335 it¦76335 happens, so that¦76337 when¦76338 it¦76339 does come to pass, you'll¦76340 be able to believe¦76340 \+add that it was preplanned\+add*.\wj*
\v 30 \wj I¦76344 won't¦76357 have much¦76343 more time to talk¦76344 to you¦76346, because¦76348 the¦76349 ruler¦76353 of¦76350 the¦76350 world¦76351 is¦76347 coming¦76347 and¦76354 he¦76358 has¦76358 nothing¦76359 in¦76355 common with me¦76356,\wj*
\v 31 \wj but¦76361 he's¦76374 coming so¦76378 that¦76362 the¦76364 world¦76365 can know¦76363 that¦76366 I¦76367 love¦76367 the¦76368 father¦76369 and¦76370 whatever the¦76376 father¦76377 told me¦76375 to do, I'm¦76379 doing¦76379 it.\wj*
\p “\wj Come on, stand up. We¦76381 need to be¦76381 leaving¦76381 this place.\wj*”
\c 15
\s1 The branches must stay connected to the vine
\rem /s1 Jesus, the True Vine; Jesus the Real Vine; The Vine and the Branches
\p
\v 1 “\wj \+em I¦76383 am¦76384\+em* the true¦76388 vine¦76386 and¦76389 my¦76392 father¦76391 is¦76395 the¦76393 farmer¦76394.\wj*
\v 2 \wj He¦76404 removes¦76404 every¦76396 one of my \+add #branches¦76397\+add* that doesn't bear¦76401 fruit¦76403, but¦76406 those that do bear fruit¦76410, he¦76413 prunes¦76413 them so they'll produce even more¦76420.\wj*
\v 3 \wj You¦76424 are¦76426 all clean¦76425 already¦76423 because¦76427 of¦76427 the¦76428 teaching that¦76430 I've¦76431 given you¦76433.\wj*
\v 4 \wj Stay¦76434 in¦76435 me¦76436, and¦76438 I¦76438 will stay in¦76439 you¦76440 all¦76440, because just as¦76441 a branch¦76443 can't¦76444 bear¦76447 fruit¦76446 in isolation when it's¦76453 not¦76451 connected to the¦76455 vine¦76456, neither¦76458 can you¦76459 if¦76460 you¦76466 don't¦76461 stay¦76466 in¦76464 me¦76465.\wj*
\p
\v 5 “\wj \+em I¦76469 am¦76471\+em* the¦76472 vine¦76473 and you¦76474 all¦76474 are¦76474 the¦76475 branches¦76476. Anyone who stays¦76478 in¦76479 me¦76480 will produce a lot of fruit¦76486—apart¦76489 from¦76489 me¦76490 you¦76492 can't¦76491 do¦76493 anything.\wj*
\v 6 \wj Anyone¦76500 who doesn't stay¦76501 in¦76503 me¦76504 will be¦76505 thrown¦76505 away like¦76508 a branch¦76510, and¦76511 will wither¦76512 and¦76513 be¦76514 gathered¦76514 together¦76514 with others, and¦76517 thrown¦76521 into¦76518 the¦76519 fire¦76520 to be¦76524 burnt¦76524.\wj*
\v 7 \wj If¦76525 you¦76528 stay¦76528 in¦76529 me¦76530 and¦76531 my¦76534 teaching stays in¦76535 you, then you can request¦76544 whatever¦76538 you¦76542 all¦76542 want¦76542 and¦76546 it¦76547 will¦76547 be¦76547 done for you¦76548.\wj*
\v 8 \wj My¦76554 father¦76553 will be¦76551 honoured and praised¦76551 when you¦76560 produce a lot of fruit¦76556, and¦76561 you¦76562 all¦76562 become¦76562 my¦76566 followers¦76567.\wj*
\v 9 \wj I¦76573 loved¦76576 you¦76575 all¦76575 just as¦76568 the¦76571 father¦76572 loved¦76569 me¦76570, so stay¦76577 in¦76578 my¦76582 love¦76580.\wj*
\v 10 \wj If¦76583 you¦76589 obey my commands¦76585, you¦76591 all¦76591 will¦76591 be¦76591 staying¦76591 in¦76592 my love¦76594, just like¦76596 I've¦76598 obeyed my father's¦76602 commands and¦76609 I¦76610 am¦76610 staying¦76610 in¦76612 his¦76611 love¦76614.\wj*
\p
\v 11 “\wj I've¦76617 told¦76617 you these¦76615 \+add >things\+add* so that¦76619 I'll be¦76626 happy with you¦76625 all¦76625, and¦76628 so that your¦76631 happiness will be¦76632 genuine and long-lasting.\wj*
\v 12 \wj So here's my¦76638 request: keep loving¦76640 each other just¦76633 like¦76643 I¦76644 loved¦76644 you¦76645 all¦76645.\wj*\x + \xo 15:12: \xt Yhn 13:34; 15:17; 1Yhn 3:23; 2Yhn 5.\x*
\v 13 \wj No¦76649 one¦76649 has¦76652 greater¦76646 love¦76648 than¦76646 the¦76655 one who gives up their own life¦76656 for¦76661 their friends¦76663.\wj*
\v 14 \wj You¦76666 are¦76670 my¦76669 friends¦76668 if¦76671 you¦76672 do¦76672 what¦76674 I¦76677 am¦76678 telling you¦76679.\wj*
\v 15 \wj I'm¦76682 not calling¦76682 you¦76683 slaves¦76684, because¦76685 a slave¦76687 doesn't know¦76689 his¦76692 master's¦76694 plans, but¦76696 I'm¦76697 calling¦76697 you friends¦76699 because¦76700 I've¦76710 told you¦76711 everything that I¦76704 heard¦76704 from¦76705 my¦76709 father¦76708.\wj*
\v 16 \wj You¦76713 didn't¦76712 choose¦76715 me¦76714, but¦76716 I¦76717 chose¦76718 you¦76719 all¦76719, and¦76720 I¦76721 assigned¦76721 you to go¦76726 and¦76727 produce fruit¦76729 and¦76732 for your¦76735 fruit¦76734 to be¦76736 permanent so that¦76738 whatever¦76739 you¦76743 request¦76743 from the¦76745 father¦76746 in¦76747 my¦76750 \+add ≈name¦76749 and authority\+add*, he¦76751 will give¦76751 it to¦76753 you¦76753.\wj*
\v 17 \wj I¦76755 am¦76755 telling you¦76756 all¦76756 this so that¦76757 you¦76758 can all¦76758 love¦76758 each other.\wj*
\s1 People will hate Yeshua-followers
\rem /s1 The World's Hatred; The World Hates the Disciples
\p
\v 18 “\wj If¦76760 the¦76761 world¦76762 hates¦76764 you¦76763, you¦76767 all¦76767 know¦76767 that¦76768 it¦76772 hated¦76772 me¦76769 before¦76770 \+add ≡it¦76772 hated¦76772\+add* you¦76771.\wj*
\v 19 \wj If¦76773 you¦76777 belonged to this world¦76776, then the¦76778 world¦76779 would¦76780 love you as it loves its¦76781 own¦76783 people, but¦76787 you¦76794 don't¦76793 belong to this world¦76792 because I¦76797 chose¦76798 you¦76799 out¦76800 of¦76800 it. That's why they hate¦76805 all of¦76803 you¦76806.\wj*
\v 20 \wj Remember¦76812 that¦76819 I¦76822 told¦76823 you¦76825 that \+add #slaves¦76829\+add* are¦76827 not¦76826 greater¦76830 than¦76830 their master¦76832.\x + \xo 15:20: \xt Mat 10:24; Luk 6:40; Yhn 13:16.\x* So if¦76834 they¦76836 persecuted¦76836 me¦76835, they'll¦76839 also¦76837 be¦76839 persecuting¦76839 you¦76838 all¦76838. (If¦76840 they'd¦76844 obeyed my¦76843 teaching, they¦76848 would also¦76845 obey your¦76847 teaching.)\wj*
\v 21 \wj But¦76850 they¦76853 will¦76853 do¦76853 all¦76852 these¦76851 \+add >things\+add* against¦76855 you¦76857 because¦76858 of¦76858 my¦76861 name¦76860, because¦76862 they¦76864 don't¦76863 know¦76864 the¦76865 father who sent¦76866 me¦76867.\wj*
\v 22 \wj They¦76876 wouldn't be¦76876 considered sinners except¦76868 that I¦76870 came¦76870 and¦76871 spoke¦76872 to¦76873 them¦76873, so now¦76877 they¦76881 don't¦76880 have¦76881 any excuse¦76879 for¦76882 their¦76885 sin¦76884.\wj*
\v 23 \wj Anyone who hates¦76888 me¦76887, also¦76889 hates¦76893 my¦76892 father¦76891.\wj*
\v 24 \wj If¦76894 I¦76898 hadn't done¦76898 miracles among¦76899 them¦76900 of the sort that¦76901 no one¦76902 else has done¦76905, they¦76909 wouldn't be considered to be sinners, but¦76911 now¦76910 they've¦76913 observed me and¦76914 hated¦76915 both¦76916 me¦76917 and¦76918 my¦76921 father¦76920.\wj*
\v 25 \wj The writings of¦76933 the prophets will certainly come to pass, that¦76935 ‘they¦76936 hated¦76936 me¦76937 undeservedly¦76938’.\wj*\x + \xo 15:25: \xt Psa 35:19; 69:4.\x*
\p
\v 26 “\wj When¦76939 the¦76942 assistant arrives¦76941 that¦76964 I¦76945 will¦76946 send¦76946 to¦76948 you¦76948 all¦76948 from¦76949 the¦76950 father¦76951, the¦76954 \+nd spirit¦76955\+nd* of¦76957 truth¦76957 coming¦76963 from¦76959 the¦76960 father¦76961, he will¦76965 tell the truth about¦76966 me¦76967.\wj*
\v 27 \wj You also¦76968 will be¦76971 able to tell the truth about me because¦76972 you¦76977 all¦76977 were¦76977 with¦76975 me¦76976 from¦76973 the¦76974 beginning¦76974.\wj*
\c 16
\p
\v 1 “\wj I've¦76979 told¦76979 you¦76980 this so that¦76981 you¦76983 won't¦76982 stumble¦76983.\wj*
\v 2 \wj First they¦76986 will¦76986 ban you¦76988 all¦76988 from their religious services, then there's a time¦76991 coming¦76990 when people will kill¦76995 you¦76996 thinking¦76997 they're \+add actually\+add* doing a¦76998 sacred¦76998 service¦76998 to \+nd God¦77002\+nd*,\wj*
\v 3 \wj but¦77003 they'll¦77005 be¦77005 doing¦77005 these¦77004 \+add >things\+add* because¦77008 they¦77010 don't¦77009 know¦77010 either the¦77011 father¦77012 or me¦77014.\wj*
\v 4 \wj I've¦77017 told¦77017 you these things so that¦77019 when¦77020 they happen in the¦77023 future, you'll¦77026 remember¦77026 that¦77029 I've¦77030 already told¦77031 you¦77032 about¦77028 them¦77028.\wj*
\s1 The work of God's spirit
\rem /s1 The Work of the Holy Spirit; The Work of the Spirit
\p “\wj I¦77040 didn't¦77039 tell¦77040 you¦77035 all¦77035 of this right at the¦77037 beginning¦77037 because¦77041 I¦77044 was¦77044 with¦77042 you¦77043 all¦77043,\wj*
\v 5 \wj but¦77046 soon I'll¦77048 be¦77048 returning to¦77049 the¦77050 one¦77054 who sent¦77051 me¦77052. Yet none of¦77055 you¦77056 are¦77057 asking¦77057 me¦77058 where¦77059 I'll be¦77060 going¦77060,\wj*
\v 6 \wj rather you are all just weighed down because¦77063 I've¦77065 told¦77065 you these¦77064 \+add >things\+add*.\wj*
\v 7 \wj But¦77073 honestly it's¦77079 for¦77080 your benefit¦77079 that¦77081 I¦77082 will leave¦77083 here, because¦77085 if¦77084 I¦77088 don't¦77087, then the¦77089 assistant won't¦77091 be¦77093 coming¦77093 to¦77095 you¦77097. But¦77099 after I've¦77102 gone¦77102, I'll¦77103 send¦77103 him¦77104 to¦77105 you¦77106 all¦77106.\wj*
\v 8 \wj When¦77107 he comes¦77108, he'll scold¦77110 the¦77111 world¦77112 about¦77113 sin¦77114 and¦77115 teach them about¦77116 righteousness¦77117 and¦77118 judgement¦77120—\wj*
\v 9 \wj about¦77121 sin¦77122 because¦77124 they¦77126 don't¦77125 believe¦77126 that I was sent by God,\wj*
\v 10 \wj about¦77129 righteousness¦77130 because¦77132 I¦77137 am¦77137 going¦77137 to¦77133 the¦77134 father¦77135 and¦77138 you¦77140 won't be¦77140 able to see¦77140 me¦77141 any longer¦77139,\wj*
\v 11 \wj and about¦77142 judgement¦77144 because¦77145 the¦77146 ruler¦77147 of¦77149 this¦77150 world¦77149 has¦77151 been¦77151 judged¦77151.\wj*
\p
\v 12 “\wj I¦77154 still¦77152 have¦77154 a lot to¦77157 tell¦77157 you¦77156 all¦77156, but¦77158 you're¦77160 not¦77159 able¦77160 to¦77162 handle it all right now¦77163.\wj*
\v 13 \wj But¦77165 when¦77164 the assistant comes¦77166, the¦77168 \+nd spirit¦77169\+nd* of¦77171 truth¦77171, he¦77173 will¦77173 guide¦77173 you¦77174 in¦77177 all¦77184 truth¦77182 because¦77186 he¦77187 won't¦77185 be¦77187 speaking¦77187 from¦77188 his own thoughts, but¦77190 will¦77194 tell you what he's¦77197 been¦77197 told¦77197, and¦77198 he¦77201 will¦77201 explain¦77201 to¦77203 you¦77203 what's still going to happen.\wj*
\v 14 \wj He'll be¦77207 honouring me¦77206 because¦77208 he'll¦77212 take¦77212 what¦77210 is¦77210 mine¦77211 and¦77213 will¦77214 explain¦77214 it to¦77216 you¦77216 all¦77216.\wj*
\v 15 \wj Everything that the¦77220 father¦77221 has¦77219 is¦77223 mine¦77222, that's why I¦77226 said¦77226 he¦77231 will take¦77231 what is¦77231 mine and¦77233 explain¦77234 it to¦77235 you¦77235.\wj*
\s1 A brief upset coming followed by happiness
\rem /s1 Sadness and Gladness; Sadness Will Be Turned to Joy; Sorrow Will Turn into Joy
\p
\v 16 “\wj It won't be much longer¦77238 and¦77237 you¦77240 won't be¦77240 able to see¦77240 me¦77241 any more, and¦77242 then a¦77244 little¦77244 while after that, and¦77245 you'll¦77246 see¦77246 me¦77247 again¦77243.”\wj*
\rem /s1 The Disciples' Grief Will Turn to Joy
\p
\v 17 \wj This got his¦77259 followers¦77258 asking¦77254 each other, “What's¦77262 all this about seeing him for not¦77270 much longer, and¦77275 then seeing him again¦77276 after a¦77277 while? And why does he say he's¦77266 going¦77285 to¦77286 the¦77287 father¦77288?\wj*”
\v 18 So¦77290 they¦77289 were¦77289 saying¦77289, “What's¦77292 this¦77294 about ‘not much longer’? We¦77301 don't¦77300 know¦77301 what¦77302 he¦77304 means.”
\p
\v 19 However \nd Yeshua¦77309\nd* knew¦77306 what they¦77314 wanted¦77314 to¦77316 ask¦77316 him¦77315, and¦77320 so he¦77321 said¦77321 to¦77322 them¦77322, “\wj You¦77325 are¦77325 trying¦77325 to \+add ≈find out\+add* from each other what I meant when I said¦77331 that you¦77335 won't¦77334 be¦77335 able to see¦77335 me¦77336 after a little while, and then a little while after that you'll¦77341 see¦77341 me¦77342 again¦77338.\wj*
\v 20 \wj I¦77345 can assure you¦77346 that¦77347 you'll¦77351 be¦77348 weeping¦77348 and¦77349 mourning but¦77353 the¦77352 world¦77354 will¦77355 be¦77355 elated¦77355. You'll¦77356 be¦77358 upset but¦77359 then your¦77362 upset will¦77365 turn¦77365 into¦77363 happiness.\wj*
\v 21 \wj A woman¦77367 giving birth¦77369 has¦77372 pains when the¦77375 delivery begins, but¦77380 when¦77379 she¦77381 hears that the¦77382 baby¦77383 is born, she doesn't remember¦77385 those pains any more because¦77389 she's¦77385 so happy that¦77392 her¦77378 child¦77383 was¦77393 born¦77393.\wj*
\v 22 \wj So¦77402 too with all¦77401 of you¦77409: you'll be¦77409 upset for a while but then I'll¦77413 be¦77413 with you¦77414 again¦77411 and¦77415 you'll¦77417 be¦77416 so happy¦77416 and¦77421 no¦77425 one¦77425 will be¦77426 able to take¦77426 that happiness away¦77426 from¦77429 you¦77430.\wj*
\p
\v 23 “\wj When¦77431 that¦77433 happens, you¦77438 won't¦77437 be¦77438 asking¦77438 me¦77436 for anything¦77449. I¦77442 can assure you¦77443 that whatever you¦77450 request¦77450 from¦77451 the¦77451 father¦77452 in¦77455 my \+add ≈name¦77457 and my¦77458 authority\+add* will¦77459 be¦77459 given¦77459 to¦77460 you¦77460.\wj*
\v 24 \wj Up until¦77461 now¦77462 you¦77464 haven't asked \+add him\+add* for anything using my¦77470 \+add ≈authority\+add*, but after that time, you'll be¦77472 able to \+add ≈make requests¦77472\+add* and¦77474 they'll be¦77475 answered so that¦77476 your¦77479 happiness will be¦77480 complete.\wj*
\s1 A new era is coming very soon
\rem /s1 Victory over the World; Peace for the Disciples
\p
