\v 13 \wj But¦78004 soon I'll¦78007 be¦78007 coming¦78007 to¦78005 you¦78006, and¦78008 I'm¦78010 speaking¦78010 these¦78009 \+add >things\+add* in¦78011 the¦78013 world¦78014 so that¦78015 they¦78016 will have¦78016 the same happiness as me and be¦78021 fulfilled¦78021 in¦78022 their lives.\wj*
