\v 3 Meanwhile Yudas¦78378 had¦78379 met¦78379 with the¦78380 soldiers and¦78382 servants¦78390 of the¦78384 chief¦78385 priests¦78385 and¦78386 the Pharisee¦78389 party¦78389, and they all started coming¦78391 into the garden with¦78393 lanterns¦78394 and¦78395 flaming torches¦78396 and¦78397 weapons¦78398.
