\v 9 (In¦78484 this way, the¦78486 statement was¦78485 fulfilled¦78485 that¦78488 \add @Yeshua¦78489\add* had said¦78489 previously: ‘I¦78496 didn't¦78495 lose¦78496 any of the ones that¦78490 you¦78492 gave¦78492 me¦78494.’)\f + \fr 18:9 \ft TD: It's not certain from the original whether v9 was part of Mark's commentary on the events or part of Yeshua's response to the arresting party.\f*
\p
